What was the thing Marshall said, whoa, chills.
马歇尔说了什么，哇，发冷。

00:44:11.030 --> 00:44:12.030
Anyone else get chills?
还有人会发冷吗？

00:44:12.030 --> 00:44:14.030
What was that at the beginning?
一开始那是什么？

