I wrote that one down to muddy.
我把那句话写得一团糟。

00:44:46.217 --> 00:44:48.623
It's it just he has nothing to say.
只是他无话可说。

00:44:48.623 --> 00:44:56.321
If he's not given it, he's one of those talking heads that has nothing to say except what's on the teleprompter.
如果他没有得到它，他就是那些除了提词器上的内容之外无话可说的人之一。

00:44:56.321 --> 00:44:59.964
He really can't get it through a meaningful sentence.
他实在是无法通过一句有意义的话来表达出来。

00:44:59.964 --> 00:45:06.013
His pink shirt and pink tie is amazing and his freak juice flowing line is also amazing.
他的粉色衬衫和粉色领带令人惊叹，他怪异的果汁流动线条也令人惊叹。

00:45:06.013 --> 00:45:22.304
I loved hearing, so we had a script supervisor named Janet Kagan who was this hilarious, lovely, delightful British woman who was always at a podium just to the side of the monitors with Pam Fryman, we would gather around for nine years.
我喜欢听，所以我们有一位名叫珍妮特·卡根（Janet Kagan）的剧本主管，她是一位搞笑、可爱、令人愉快的英国女性，她总是和帕姆·弗莱曼（Pam Fryman）一起站在讲台上，就在监视器旁​​边，我们会聚集在一起九年。

00:45:22.304 --> 00:45:25.603
We gathered around her podium before big scenes.
在大场面之前，我们聚集在她的讲台周围。

00:45:25.603 --> 00:45:27.115
We ran lines with her.
我们和她一起排队。

00:45:27.115 --> 00:45:31.790
She was so funny, such a delightful essential presence on the stage.
她很有趣，是舞台上令人愉快的重要存在。

00:45:31.789 --> 00:45:33.510
But we hear her voice.
但我们听到了她的声音。

00:45:33.510 --> 00:45:36.873
I think she even says, this is Janet Kagan.
我想她甚至说，这是珍妮特·卡根。

00:45:36.873 --> 00:45:42.425
She's the one who offers Alia, her summer fellowship acceptance, right?
她是向阿莉亚提供夏季奖学金的人，对吧？

